@startuml

title Lobby and game creation

participant Client
participant Server

Client->Server: LobbyRequest
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Lobby(lobby snapshot)

loop while the player remains in the lobby
Client->Server: LobbyRequest
Server-->Client: joinable games and available seats
end

group create a game
Client->Server: CreateGameRequest(gameName, playerCount)

alt game name is available
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Snapshot(Game created, snapshot)
else game name already exists
Server-->Client: GameOperationResult.Err(GAME_NAME_TAKEN, lobby snapshot)
end
end

note over Client, Server
The lobby only exposes games that have not started
and still have at least one available seat.
end note

@enduml
